  "format": "recallweave-deck/1",
  "title": "Repeated evidence: two flags, three models",
  "attribution": "Original questions, explanations, transfer prompts and fictional teaching populations authored for RecallWeave by estate-234cae4aee53 with AI assistance. Mathematical background: MIT 18.05 (Spring 2022), Reading 3, and MIT 6.041/6.431 (Fall 2010), Lecture 3. Primary links and worked derivations are in courses/repeated-evidence.md. These exact counts are teaching inputs, not empirical observations; no source exercise, prose or illustration is reproduced.",
